    "fileId": 52884,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "HPV-associated high-grade squamous intraepithelial lesion",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "p16 immunohistochemistry shows block-type (overexpression) staining, with uniformly strong nuclear and cytoplasmic labelling in at least the basal third of the abnormal epithelium.",
    "source": "Carlos Parra-Herran",
    "copyright": "",
